#This file is the priority table for python operators

#Top to Bottom Priority/Precedence

#1. Parentheses/()
#2. Exponentiation/**
#3. Unary plus and minus, and bitwise not/ +x, -x, ~x
#4. Mult, Div, Floor Div, Modulo/*, /, //, %
#5. Add, Subtract/+, -
#6. Bitwise L&R Shift/ <<, >>
#7. Bitwise And/&
#8. Bitwise Xor/^
#9. Bitwise Or/|
#10. Comparison Operators and Membership operators
#10.1 ==, !=, >, >=, <=, <=, is, is not, in, not in
#11. Logical NOT/not
#12. Logical AND/and
#13. Logical OR/or